            "",
            "2 Alauc khou <~1 Jisu khou",
            "lwmmei nunc,",
            "Jisu zauzian hei kachangc e,thaymei",
            "Kaniw lwmloumei nunc e,",
            "“Lauziu Nac zei khou khiu the.”",
            "",
            "3 Pingmei ric khou mai chung khou ding khwanmei,",
            "Bauc kanmei nunc 1<~ kaniw guay hei e,",
            "Jisu saa e: “Dwan-gay ni,”",
            "“Lauziu Nac zei khou khiu the",
            "",
            "4 Gaanhmei tingkauh ramc khou gayna tangc the,",
            "Suhmei, theihmei, paapc ryanramei maek khe,",
            "’Taw thu neihlaa suang ni the;",
            "“Lauziu Nac zei khou khiu the.”"
